                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How much does Karwa Chauth drive for jewelry brands?</h3>
                                        <p>15-25% of October / November revenue. Highest concentrated single-occasion moment for married-women jewelry.</p>
                                        <h3>Should pan-India brands target regional occasions?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes — regional occasion targeting during regional peaks drives incremental revenue without dilution. Regional-language + culturally-authentic creative required.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the ideal occasion marketing lead time?</h3>
                                        <p>4-6 weeks for serious campaigns. Creative + inventory + creator commitments need lead time.</p>
                                        <h3>How do I convert occasion buyers to regular customers?</h3>
